        <li><span class="glyph">✦</span><div><h4>Private Viewing</h4><p>After-hours access for serious collectors, by appointment.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="glyph">✦</span><div><h4>Workshop</h4><p>Hands-on sessions: styling, wiring, repotting — from beginner to advanced.</p></div></li>
